{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"中非共和国","country_iso":"CAF","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:10:02.397680","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"CAF-HB-0001","ldc":"Yes","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"中非15兆瓦光伏电站项目","project_name_en":"Central Africa 15MW Solar PV Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"天津电建","content":"近日，中国能建天津电建援建的中非光伏电站项目\n光伏区\n全部并网发电。\n中国援中非光伏电站项目是2018年9月中非合作论坛北京峰会期间\n两国元首达成的重要共识，\n被中非政府列为\n双边合作龙头项目，\n是中非目前最大民生工程。\n该项目于2021年4月8日开工\n天津电建负责\n新建15兆瓦太阳能光伏电站1座\n新建63千伏升压站1座\n5兆瓦时储能系统1套\n以及配套输变电线路\n新华社报道\n中非共和国总统参与该项目奠基仪式\n项目建设期间\n全体参建人员克服\n当地政局不稳\n疟疾伤寒\n物资匮乏\n物流滞后\n等诸多困难\n中国驻中非共和国大使陈栋前往项目慰问、视察\n抗疫和生产一起抓\n统一思想\n迎难而上\n全力以赴\n严把安全关、质量关\n坚韧推进项目履约\n中非政府新任总理视察援中非光伏电站项目\n中非共和国电力紧缺\n首都供电率35%\n全国供电率仅8%\n该项目建成后\n将有效缓解中非电力紧缺状况\n对全面深化两国友好关系\n提升两国合作水平\n打造两国友谊纽带具有重要意义","content_sha256":"4eb5ab8079019ced57ec6d3cf57af13f7e3bd0248c64e2fcda1a9f675fbe4e82","id":16033,"publish_date":"2022-06-19 14:37:02","title":"祝贺！中非最大民生工程并网发电","title_sha256":"5cb606d77e15b1411b40c1b45f133a62e0594541e92584afdd32a52d64ed451b","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/29448.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"CAF-HB-0001","capacity_details":"PV: 15MW, BESS: 5MWh","capacity_mw":15.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"15","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:10:02.398495","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"CAF-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.scio.gov.cn/gxzl/ydyl_26587/jmwl_26592/jmwl_26593/202510/t20251028_936866.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2021-04-08","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null